@startuml 01-hub-identity
title Smart E-Mobility Hub â€” Hub & Identity Class Diagram

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Hub & Identity" {

class User {
  - userId: String
  - name: String
  - email: String
  - phone: String
  - role: Role
  + updatePermittedProfile(email: String, phone: String): void
}

enum Role {
  STUDENT
  OPERATOR
}

class Session {
  - sessionId: String
  - userId: String
  - role: Role
  - createdAt: DateTime
  - expiresAt: DateTime
  + isActive(now: DateTime): boolean
}

class MobilityHub {
  - hubId: String
  - name: String
  - location: Location
  - operationalStatus: HubStatus
  - vehicleCapacity: int
  - availableVehicles: int
  - parkingCapacity: int
  - occupiedParking: int
  - chargingPointCapacity: int
  - availableChargingPoints: int
  - lastUpdated: DateTime
}

enum HubStatus {
  ACTIVE
  PEAK_LOAD
  MAINTENANCE
  OFFLINE
}

class Location {
  - latitude: double
  - longitude: double
  - address: String
}

class AuthService {
  + authenticate(identifier: String, credential: String): Session
  + authorize(session: Session, requiredRole: Role): boolean
  + endSession(sessionId: String): void
}

class HubService {
  + findHubs(criteria: HubSearchCriteria): List<MobilityHub>
  + getHubStatus(hubId: String): MobilityHub
  + findAlternativeHubs(criteria: HubSearchCriteria): List<MobilityHub>
}

class HubSearchCriteria {
  - location: Location
  - radiusKm: double
  - requiredServices: Set<String>
}

}

User "1" -- "0..*" Session : owns
Session --> Role
User --> Role
MobilityHub "1" *-- "1" Location
MobilityHub --> HubStatus
AuthService ..> User : authenticates
AuthService ..> Session : creates/ends
HubService --> MobilityHub : queries
HubService --> HubSearchCriteria : uses
HubService ..> Location : filters by

note right of User
Identity and role are preserved.
Only permitted profile fields
may be changed.
end note

note right of MobilityHub
Single ownership of Hub state.
Other modules reference the Hub
through HubService/contracts.
end note

note bottom of HubService
UC-H02: find/filter Hubs
UC-H03: view Hub status
UC-X01: find alternative Hubs
end note

@enduml
